                    "href": "https://api.github.com/repos/cython/cython/pulls/comments/4657210231"
                }
            },
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Rather than simply reverting the code to the previous brittle state, I'd rather do something like this (pending a better node to create).\n```suggestion\n        if isinstance(index, int):\n            index_node = IntNode.for_size(self.pos, index)\n        else:\n            # Create something opaque with a 'ssize_t' type.\n            index_node = RawCNameExprNode(self.pos, type=PyrexTypes.c_py_ssize_t_type)\n            index_node.constant_result = index\n        return IndexNode(self.pos, base=self, index=index_node)\n```",
            "commit_id": "81e93f8764a9c78ba870beb86b96010abf4471da",
            "copilot_code_review_severity": null,
            "copilot_code_review_sources": [],
            "created_at": "2026-11-22T07:39:56Z",
            "diff_hunk": "@@ -753,7 +753,12 @@ def inferable_item_node(self, index=0):\n         Return a node that represents the (type) result of an indexing operation,\n         e.g. for tuple unpacking or iteration.\n         \"\"\"\n-        return IndexNode(self.pos, base=self, index=IntNode.for_size(self.pos, index))\n+        if index is not_a_constant:\n+            index_node = IntNode(self.pos, value=str(index), constant_result=index,\n+                                 type=PyrexTypes.c_py_ssize_t_type)\n+        else:\n+            index_node = IntNode.for_size(self.pos, index)\n+        return IndexNode(self.pos, base=self, index=index_node)",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/8151#discussion_r4657210231",
